(7248037, 1126036, 121111, '<td valign="top">One of the best session I have done was doing projections on a model , it was fascinating <br/> <br/>It is very nice to see the pattern on the body, when combined with light and shadows , in my opinion takes it to the next level, to do that you need to be sideways from the projector</td>', 'One of the best session I have done was doing projections on a model , it was fascinating  It is very nice to see the pattern on the body, when combined with light and shadows , in my opinion takes it to the next level, to do that you need to be sideways from the projector', '2014-08-06 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
