(7249988, 1126528, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Love that rich red and the deep stare she''s giving. Not sure how well this will do in this challenge because "Pattern" isn''t very prominent, but it''s still a great image.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Love that rich red and the deep stare she''s giving. Not sure how well this will do in this challenge because "Pattern" isn''t very prominent, but it''s still a great image.', '2014-08-10 20:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
