(7250370, 1126560, 114225, '<td valign="top">I bit more brightness here would really make this pop.</td>', 'I bit more brightness here would really make this pop.', '2014-08-11 16:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250373, 1126554, 173844, '<td valign="top">A seemingly effortless pattern of varied post stumps, rising above a dreamy background of underwater rocks, it is marvelously captivating and restful.  Deceptively humble.  The colors are modest and harmonious.  I especially like how the partially wet and partially dry posts hint at ebb and flow.  My favorite in the challenge.  The numerous sensor spots (if that''s what they are) are an unfortunate distraction.</td>', 'A seemingly effortless pattern of varied post stumps, rising above a dreamy background of underwater rocks, it is marvelously captivating and restful.  Deceptively humble.  The colors are modest and harmonious.  I especially like how the partially wet and partially dry posts hint at ebb and flow.  My favorite in the challenge.  The numerous sensor spots (if that''s what they are) are an unfortunate distraction.', '2014-08-11 16:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250374, 1126036, 173844, '<td valign="top">A perfect example of elevating a merely interesting sun-flung pattern into something artful and compelling.  Admirable and fun.  What a lovely palette of golden browns!  I like the placement of the model and her pose.  My second favorite in the challenger.</td>', 'A perfect example of elevating a merely interesting sun-flung pattern into something artful and compelling.  Admirable and fun.  What a lovely palette of golden browns!  I like the placement of the model and her pose.  My second favorite in the challenger.', '2014-08-11 16:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250379, 1126242, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful hi-tech playground.  The buildings, though basically graph-like in facade, handsomely reflect the lowering sun to provide a stunning backdrop to the ferris wheel.  The lovely coup de grace is the sunset''s capture by the four ferris wheel compartments, like a procession of snow globes or Christmas ornaments.  There''s pattern galore here, but it doesn''t feel in your face to me.  <br/>Purely subjective notion: maybe crop it on the right from the two vertical columns outward.</td>', 'Beautiful hi-tech playground.  The buildings, though basically graph-like in facade, handsomely reflect the lowering sun to provide a stunning backdrop to the ferris wheel.  The lovely coup de grace is the sunset''s capture by the four ferris wheel compartments, like a procession of snow globes or Christmas ornaments.  There''s pattern galore here, but it doesn''t feel in your face to me.  Purely subjective notion: maybe crop it on the right from the two vertical columns outward.', '2014-08-11 16:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250382, 1126124, 173844, '<td valign="top">This strange pattern in amber is a revelation of kiwi-ness, a much-appeciated reminder of the infinite bounty awaiting discovery by the curious artistic sensibility. Bravo to the photographer.  It offers a platform from which the imagination can wander.</td>', 'This strange pattern in amber is a revelation of kiwi-ness, a much-appeciated reminder of the infinite bounty awaiting discovery by the curious artistic sensibility. Bravo to the photographer.  It offers a platform from which the imagination can wander.', '2014-08-11 16:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250384, 1126264, 173844, '<td valign="top">Okay, the title says "Silver shade," and I''ll take it at its word, but I see ranks of people bearing metallic banners on parade.  It''s a wonderfully suggestive pattern, bright and joyful.  I like the range of color tones.</td>', 'Okay, the title says "Silver shade," and I''ll take it at its word, but I see ranks of people bearing metallic banners on parade.  It''s a wonderfully suggestive pattern, bright and joyful.  I like the range of color tones.', '2014-08-11 17:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250385, 1126229, 173844, '<td valign="top">A bouquet of patterns, fun and exciting.  Fine composition and perfect in black and white, reflecting the nostalgic feel of the wooden roller coaster.  This image would make a terrific poster.</td>', 'A bouquet of patterns, fun and exciting.  Fine composition and perfect in black and white, reflecting the nostalgic feel of the wooden roller coaster.  This image would make a terrific poster.', '2014-08-11 17:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250398, 1126553, 173844, '<td valign="top">It may be a gallery, but you''ve caught and highlighted the mesmerizing, transitory pattern of those blinds thrown across the wall and ceiling.  It brings the outside in, a wandering cloud of sun and shadow.  The composition is excellent.  The heavy grain works very well.</td>', 'It may be a gallery, but you''ve caught and highlighted the mesmerizing, transitory pattern of those blinds thrown across the wall and ceiling.  It brings the outside in, a wandering cloud of sun and shadow.  The composition is excellent.  The heavy grain works very well.', '2014-08-11 17:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250399, 1126260, 173844, '<td valign="top">Absolutely spot on depth of field, highlighting the protagonist on his/her web.  The magical point is how the slice of the web implies the entirety of the pattern splayed out within the bokeh.  Admirably fashioned.</td>', 'Absolutely spot on depth of field, highlighting the protagonist on his/her web.  The magical point is how the slice of the web implies the entirety of the pattern splayed out within the bokeh.  Admirably fashioned.', '2014-08-11 17:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250400, 1126350, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully handled composition of classic receding pattern.  The detail and color are perfect. This is sure to garner a very high rating, and deservedly so.  I love the splash of red on the mechanism on the pipe.  A dizzying confection.</td>', 'Beautifully handled composition of classic receding pattern.  The detail and color are perfect. This is sure to garner a very high rating, and deservedly so.  I love the splash of red on the mechanism on the pipe.  A dizzying confection.', '2014-08-11 17:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250401, 1126378, 58634, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones. Nice position of the butterlfy, too.</td>', 'Lovely tones. Nice position of the butterlfy, too.', '2014-08-11 17:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250402, 1126553, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very geometric yet in a very simplistic way.</td>', 'Very geometric yet in a very simplistic way.', '2014-08-11 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250403, 1126124, 58634, '<td valign="top">Rotten kiwi? I like the feel that this has</td>', 'Rotten kiwi? I like the feel that this has', '2014-08-11 17:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250404, 1126190, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like that there are lots of different patterns to look at.</td>', 'I like that there are lots of different patterns to look at.', '2014-08-11 17:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250405, 1126291, 58634, '<td valign="top">The addition of the feet really helps the composition IMO</td>', 'The addition of the feet really helps the composition IMO', '2014-08-11 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250406, 1126079, 58634, '<td valign="top">SO simple yet highly effective! I''m impressed at how perfectly positioned they all are!</td>', 'SO simple yet highly effective! I''m impressed at how perfectly positioned they all are!', '2014-08-11 17:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250407, 1126274, 58634, '<td valign="top">The red really pops out here. I like.</td>', 'The red really pops out here. I like.', '2014-08-11 17:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250408, 1126134, 58634, '<td valign="top">Love the texture on that wood.</td>', 'Love the texture on that wood.', '2014-08-11 17:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250409, 1126032, 58634, '<td valign="top">Wow, there''s so many of them!</td>', 'Wow, there''s so many of them!', '2014-08-11 17:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250410, 1125960, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like all the detail</td>', 'I like all the detail', '2014-08-11 17:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250411, 1126394, 58634, '<td valign="top">The lighting really creates some beautiful shadows.</td>', 'The lighting really creates some beautiful shadows.', '2014-08-11 17:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
