(7250413, 1125961, 173844, '<td valign="top">A magical tour de force of bubble wrap (or some such) fronting a lit-up scene.  Both halves of the title are perfectly descriptive  --  might be suitable to offer just one.  I''m really taken by this imaginative pattern.</td>', 'A magical tour de force of bubble wrap (or some such) fronting a lit-up scene.  Both halves of the title are perfectly descriptive  --  might be suitable to offer just one.  I''m really taken by this imaginative pattern.', '2014-08-11 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250416, 1126274, 173844, '<td valign="top">Elegant pattern of silver chairs, with the woman in red as the cherry on top.  I like the natural ease of this image and congratulate the photographer for his/her patient disposition in allowing the scene to speak for itself.</td>', 'Elegant pattern of silver chairs, with the woman in red as the cherry on top.  I like the natural ease of this image and congratulate the photographer for his/her patient disposition in allowing the scene to speak for itself.', '2014-08-11 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250418, 1126018, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen elegant patch in the tunnel, glossy and rhythmic, like a strip of taffy.  I like how it''s both realistic and abstract.</td>', 'Nicely seen elegant patch in the tunnel, glossy and rhythmic, like a strip of taffy.  I like how it''s both realistic and abstract.', '2014-08-11 17:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250419, 1126190, 173844, '<td valign="top">A well-composed scene that reveals a patchwork quilt of patterns and tones.  Modest, subtle and artistic.  Beautifully exposed.  The water on the floor is a great touch.  Very satisfying.</td>', 'A well-composed scene that reveals a patchwork quilt of patterns and tones.  Modest, subtle and artistic.  Beautifully exposed.  The water on the floor is a great touch.  Very satisfying.', '2014-08-11 17:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250420, 1126377, 173844, '<td valign="top">Of all the flowers featured in this challenge, I find this one to be the most stunning and fascinating.  The pattern is compelling.  The transitions from bud to petals are exquisite.  Outstanding image.</td>', 'Of all the flowers featured in this challenge, I find this one to be the most stunning and fascinating.  The pattern is compelling.  The transitions from bud to petals are exquisite.  Outstanding image.', '2014-08-11 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250423, 1126495, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very elegant study of pattern, rhythm and tone.  Beautifully composed.  A sensitive blossom.</td>', 'Very elegant study of pattern, rhythm and tone.  Beautifully composed.  A sensitive blossom.', '2014-08-11 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250427, 1125973, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wow! This Escher-like photograph has a lot of interesting things going on.  Patterns abound in the brickwork, stairs and railings and ferns.  It comes together rather well, but personally I''m a bit overwhelmed.  The person descending the staircase is an important anchor.  Still, I gave it a high mark because of its ebullience.</td>', 'Wow! This Escher-like photograph has a lot of interesting things going on.  Patterns abound in the brickwork, stairs and railings and ferns.  It comes together rather well, but personally I''m a bit overwhelmed.  The person descending the staircase is an important anchor.  Still, I gave it a high mark because of its ebullience.', '2014-08-11 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250429, 1126444, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lovely image of waves of incoming mountains and farm rows, a gentle and peaceful pattern.  The colors are delicate and in harmony.  An abstract tapestry.</td>', 'A lovely image of waves of incoming mountains and farm rows, a gentle and peaceful pattern.  The colors are delicate and in harmony.  An abstract tapestry.', '2014-08-11 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
