(7250535, 1126523, 173844, '<td valign="top">A cozy lineup of huggable airplanes with an apocalyptic grace note.  Strangely riveting and powerful.  A strong and crackling combination.</td>', 'A cozy lineup of huggable airplanes with an apocalyptic grace note.  Strangely riveting and powerful.  A strong and crackling combination.', '2014-08-12 01:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250537, 1126221, 173844, '<td valign="top">A vivid silhouetted pattern.  We know how exacting this maneuver is, yet here we have it playing out against the gauzy serenity of a beautiful mountain under a wispy sky.  A wonderful contrast is set up here, the transition being those sweeping contrails, from sharp to windblown.  Nice balance.</td>', 'A vivid silhouetted pattern.  We know how exacting this maneuver is, yet here we have it playing out against the gauzy serenity of a beautiful mountain under a wispy sky.  A wonderful contrast is set up here, the transition being those sweeping contrails, from sharp to windblown.  Nice balance.', '2014-08-12 01:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250538, 1126526, 173844, '<td valign="top">A pleasantly complex pattern with sharp contrasts, tiptoeing along the edge of abstraction.  Coyly observed.</td>', 'A pleasantly complex pattern with sharp contrasts, tiptoeing along the edge of abstraction.  Coyly observed.', '2014-08-12 01:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250540, 1126176, 173844, '<td valign="top">A rhythmic, fluid composition with people and flags in stripes and checks, as is the surrounding architecture.  It looks deceptively effortless but is strongly balanced and interesting. A nicely unified whole.</td>', 'A rhythmic, fluid composition with people and flags in stripes and checks, as is the surrounding architecture.  It looks deceptively effortless but is strongly balanced and interesting. A nicely unified whole.', '2014-08-12 01:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250542, 1126352, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great colors, more dazzling than fireworks.</td>', 'Great colors, more dazzling than fireworks.', '2014-08-12 01:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250543, 1126239, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, leaves are patterned.  What I really like about this is how you seem to dip it in sunlight, showing us new and unexpected beauty.  The lower colors are wonderfully nuanced and delicate.</td>', 'Yes, leaves are patterned.  What I really like about this is how you seem to dip it in sunlight, showing us new and unexpected beauty.  The lower colors are wonderfully nuanced and delicate.', '2014-08-12 01:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250544, 1126064, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and sinuous pattern.  I want to see a wider expanse of this lapis lazuli tapestry.</td>', 'Lovely colors and sinuous pattern.  I want to see a wider expanse of this lapis lazuli tapestry.', '2014-08-12 01:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250545, 1126493, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sharply vivid colors and shapes in this graph-ic reflection.  I appreciate how the rigid pattern contains fluid, phantasmagorical insets.</td>', 'Sharply vivid colors and shapes in this graph-ic reflection.  I appreciate how the rigid pattern contains fluid, phantasmagorical insets.', '2014-08-12 01:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
