(7250643, 1126536, 173844, '<td valign="top">Intricate free-form 3D pattern that invites a sense of wonder at the bounty of nature.  Sounds trite, but it''s heartfelt.  Is this a sponge or a coral?  Satisfying detail and composition.  The orange background is a good choice.</td>', 'Intricate free-form 3D pattern that invites a sense of wonder at the bounty of nature.  Sounds trite, but it''s heartfelt.  Is this a sponge or a coral?  Satisfying detail and composition.  The orange background is a good choice.', '2014-08-12 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250646, 1126036, 150277, '<td valign="top">So unusual.  I like the lighting and the model''s pose.</td>', 'So unusual.  I like the lighting and the model''s pose.', '2014-08-12 15:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250647, 1126350, 150277, '<td valign="top">I really liked the lighting and processing of this image.  Great shot IMO.</td>', 'I really liked the lighting and processing of this image.  Great shot IMO.', '2014-08-12 15:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250649, 1126463, 150277, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful to me.  I like the simplicity of the pattern, but the lighting and the composition give movement to the image.  Just great.</td>', 'Very beautiful to me.  I like the simplicity of the pattern, but the lighting and the composition give movement to the image.  Just great.', '2014-08-12 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250650, 1126475, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, moody image.  The latticework of this open cylinder is charming in its serious embrace of nothing.  It''s a zen structure.... suggestively.  And the emptiness of the lead-in street expands the ''notion.''  I like this a lot.  Just wish the top of the structure had at least a sliver of sky above it.</td>', 'Beautiful, moody image.  The latticework of this open cylinder is charming in its serious embrace of nothing.  It''s a zen structure.... suggestively.  And the emptiness of the lead-in street expands the ''notion.''  I like this a lot.  Just wish the top of the structure had at least a sliver of sky above it.', '2014-08-12 15:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250651, 1126549, 150277, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting - I like the singularity of pattern with that darkness that gives the image such depth.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting - I like the singularity of pattern with that darkness that gives the image such depth.', '2014-08-12 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250652, 1126439, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wow, interesting and well photographed.  Everything seems so sharp.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow, interesting and well photographed.  Everything seems so sharp.  Well done.', '2014-08-12 15:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250653, 1126497, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the lighting, but the pattern is a bit too crazy to really represent pattern strongly to me.</td>', 'I like the colors and the lighting, but the pattern is a bit too crazy to really represent pattern strongly to me.', '2014-08-12 15:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250654, 1126559, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really like it, but am bothered by the lack of a vertical or horizontal along the rail.  I don''t think that would have hurt the photo.</td>', 'Really like it, but am bothered by the lack of a vertical or horizontal along the rail.  I don''t think that would have hurt the photo.', '2014-08-12 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250655, 1126447, 156466, '<td valign="top">if you''re going to do bricks then use your perspective correction to get the lines either even or interesting.</td>', 'if you''re going to do bricks then use your perspective correction to get the lines either even or interesting.', '2014-08-12 15:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250656, 1126378, 173844, '<td valign="top">The posture of the moth on a flower elevates this above pedestrian for me.  Now it''s a charming hood ornament awaiting the car that can do it justice.</td>', 'The posture of the moth on a flower elevates this above pedestrian for me.  Now it''s a charming hood ornament awaiting the car that can do it justice.', '2014-08-12 15:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250657, 1126032, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I hate the busy horizon.  With nothing you can do about that in this light I would have cropped at the water line.  A little awkward, but less distracting.</td>', 'Great shot but I hate the busy horizon.  With nothing you can do about that in this light I would have cropped at the water line.  A little awkward, but less distracting.', '2014-08-12 15:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250658, 1126264, 156466, '<td valign="top">Almost too busy.  OK, not almost.  I''d love to see a closer crop, perhaps.</td>', 'Almost too busy.  OK, not almost.  I''d love to see a closer crop, perhaps.', '2014-08-12 15:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7250659, 1126561, 156466, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to figure it out.  Very cool idea.  I''d be giving this a 9 or maybe a 10 if the horizontal lines weren''t off.  Some are straight, more are not and it''s making my OCD react badly.</td>', 'Took me a while to figure it out.  Very cool idea.  I''d be giving this a 9 or maybe a 10 if the horizontal lines weren''t off.  Some are straight, more are not and it''s making my OCD react badly.', '2014-08-12 15:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
